# Line endings: always LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Why: the bash scripts (scripts/*.sh) and SQL files run inside Linux containers (CI, Supabase,
# plain PostgreSQL). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turns them into CRLF, and bash then
# fails on `set -o pipefail\r`. Forcing LF keeps local runs identical to CI on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
